# Measurement fixtures: the INPUTS are checked in, the records they produce are
# not. A committed record could go stale and mask a real change in the builder —
# the exact failure the c5-provenance-replay fixture exists to detect. Its
# record is the one deliberate exception (it must disagree with its own trace).
scripts/fixtures/measurement/*/measurement.json
